格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"面向数学笔记的 DeepSeek Harness 助手，驻留在 Obsidian 右侧栏。可直接读写数学笔记，维护分层长期记忆（画像、主题、类型化记录、原始证据），按 Rethlas 风格证明工作流工作，内置个人定理索引与问题模板库，并能把关键想法捕捉到备忘录、主动提醒打磨。","id":"gh:1334734614","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-obsidian-math","slug":"maple110011/dsh-obsidian-math","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","obsidian","obsidian-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"面向数学笔记的 DeepSeek Harness 助手，驻留在 Obsidian 右侧栏。可直接读写数学笔记，维护分层长期记忆（画像、主题、类型化记录、原始证据），按 Rethlas 风格证明工作流工"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"作，内置个人定理索引与问题模板库，并能把关键想法捕捉到备忘录、主动提醒打磨。"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DSH Math Notes Assistant (dsh-math-memory)"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English · 简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> A math-notes assistant that lives in Obsidian's right sidebar and remembers what you were working "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"on between sessions."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Most chat assistants forget everything when a conversation ends. This one keeps your notes and a lon"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"g-term memory inside your own vault, so a new session can pick up where the last one stopped. Everyt"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"hing stays on your machine."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Remembers across sessions.** It keeps a profile, typed memory cards, idea memos and raw conversa"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"tion evidence in `.deepseek/`, all as plain Markdown you can read and edit.\n- **Finds things in one "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"search.** `note_recall` searches your notes and all memory layers together, then reads the best hits"},{"id":"p7s4","text":" before answering.\n- **Lets you review and correct.** A memory panel shows what it knows; each card "},{"id":"p7s5","text":"can be confirmed, marked wrong or archived, and replies link back to the cards they used.\n- **Stays "},{"id":"p7s6","text":"out of the way.** Notes stay in your vault, the service listens on localhost only, and the assistant"},{"id":"p7s7","text":" has no shell, no web access and no delete tools."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Current status"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Version **0.8.3**, still a prototype. The \"remember, find, correct\" loop works end to end. What is s"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"till missing is the harder half: helping you build mathematical understanding — knowing where you ar"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"e stuck, what to practise next, and how to reuse your own techniques. That is what 1.0 means. The cu"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"rrent state and open work are kept in docs/README.md."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"**A. From Obsidian (recommended).** Settings → Community plugins → Browse, search **DSH Math Notes A"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"ssistant**, then install and enable it. On first run the plugin finds DeepSeek Harness, sets up its "},{"id":"p11s3","text":"configuration and vault templates, and starts the service."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"**B. From the command line.**"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**C. Manually.** Download `main.js`, `manifest.json` and `styles.css` from the latest release and co"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"py them into `<vault>/.obsidian/plugins/dsh-math-assistant/`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"- Obsidian desktop and Node.js 22.5 or newer.\n- DeepSeek Harness (`@deepseek-ai/dsh`, **requires ≥ 0"},{"id":"p16s2","text":".1.7-rc.2**) with a configured DeepSeek model.\n- Default port 3180. The regular dsh web uses 3080; t"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"he two can run at the same time."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Vault layout"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## After install"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Open the sidebar and start a conversation. At the start of each session the assistant reads `AGENTS."},{"id":"p20s2","text":"md` and the memory index. To see or correct what it remembers, open the memory panel; to change what"},{"id":"p20s3","text":" is captured automatically, use the capture-policy row in the panel or the plugin settings."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"## Project and development"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"- Current state and open work: docs/README.md\n- How the two components fit together: ARCHITECTURE.md"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"\n- Install and release details: docs/installation.md, docs/release.md\n- Why decisions were made: doc"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"s/changelog.md\n- Before changing memory or retrieval: docs/memory/README.md\n- The agent's tools: fou"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"r note tools (`note_recall`, `note_strategy`, `note_create`, `note_links`) plus file read/write/sear"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"ote tools (`note_recall`, `note_strategy`, `note_create`, `note_links`) plus file read/write/search."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Development commands:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"- Version: **0.8.3**"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Privacy"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Everything runs locally: the service binds to 127.0.0.1, memory is Markdown inside your vault, and t"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"he session index never leaves the machine."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
